{"id":"9b3d91c91ef33900","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference.md","title":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — TB与UTB的去引号模式不同","display":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — TB与UTB的去引号模式不同","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference","aliases":["91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference"],"display":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — TB与UTB的去引号模式不同","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — TB与UTB的去引号模式不同"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference-—-TB-与-UTB-的去引号模式不同\">fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — TB 与 UTB 的去引号模式不同</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span>\n(TB 的闭句去引号实例集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span>\n(UTB 的统一去引号实例集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n(基础语言句子与公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n(数码代入编码的对象语言函数项)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}TB\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}TB\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\n\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\\psi\n\\right]:\n\\begin{array}{l}\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\n\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\\psi\n\\right]:\n\\begin{array}{l}\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>TB 给每个闭算术句一个双条件；UTB 给每个基础语言公式一个带参数的\n一致双条件。UTB 的 “U” 表示 uniform，而不是把 T-schema 扩展到任意\n含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的句子。</p>\n<p>因此两者都避免直接对自指真理句实例化全 T-schema，并且标准版本都对\nPA 的算术语言保守。UTB 的优势是能在一个公理实例中统一处理所有参数，\n不是获得新的算术后果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference-—-TB-与-UTB-的去引号模式不同","text":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — TB 与 UTB 的去引号模式不同","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}^{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}TB\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_n\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)}^{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\n\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\\psi\n\\right]:\n\\begin{array}{l}\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1860,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","95643c507a4d6dc3"]}